   "statementText": "The synthetic assessment is NOT_ASSURED. CG-07 (critical control-system integrity) FAILS on PARTIAL CRITICAL controls MCF-OPS-013 and MCF-SEC-005, and its FAIL ceiling is NOT_ASSURED for the Service Outcomes that depend on BMS supervision of power and cooling (RF-06, required by SO-01); the decision question is not partitioned by outcome, so that ceiling applies to SO-01 to SO-03. CG-03 and CG-15 also FAIL (NOT_ASSURED for the outcomes their defeated dependency and authority paths reach; LIMITED for the decision as a whole). The CG-01 and CG-05 UNKNOWN gates and the systemic US5 UNKNOWN U-003 on the facility water plant each cap the decision at INCONCLUSIVE; none raises it above NOT_ASSURED, because a demonstrated gate failure is not softened by undetermined positions.",
